It could be a new column
just called case rate.

00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:44.460
Currently, it's individual case rates

00:27:44.460 --> 00:27:48.140
switching to this long
format, case rates long.

00:27:52.520 --> 00:27:56.610
And just like that, we have
our weeks, we have our MODZCTA

