because that's going to
affect the type of join you do

00:29:57.700 --> 00:30:02.450
in this case, we're matching
to the kind of leftmost one

00:30:02.450 --> 00:30:05.130
but and then of course
you can pipe this in.

00:30:05.130 --> 00:30:10.130
So we're first matching case
rates long 2% positive long

00:30:10.520 --> 00:30:14.220
