00:58:22.480 --> 00:58:24.900
which I think is arguably
the most concerning metric

00:58:24.900 --> 00:58:26.360
and a sense of urgency.

00:58:26.360 --> 00:58:28.900
So I added that red color
to be associated with that.

00:58:28.900 --> 00:58:30.610
You have to always think about,

00:58:30.610 --> 00:58:32.220
