00:58:32.220 --> 00:58:33.670
It's not just an accessibility thing

00:58:33.670 --> 00:58:35.230
of like someone being color blind,

00:58:35.230 --> 00:58:36.650
which is very important to consider

00:58:36.650 --> 00:58:39.090
but it's also the associations people

00:58:39.090 --> 00:58:40.830
have with color, right?

00:58:40.830 --> 00:58:44.890
So green here, people tend to
associate it's a calmer color.

00:58:44.890 --> 00:58:47.960
It's a more like active
color, which is why I used it

00:58:47.960 --> 00:58:49.910
