00:58:58.620 --> 00:58:59.990
and darker being more,

00:58:59.990 --> 00:59:02.380
I think doing the reverse will
be confusing in my opinion.

00:59:02.380 --> 00:59:05.740
But again, this is,
there's no science to this.

00:59:05.740 --> 00:59:08.740
